WEBVTT

01:27.705 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:34.905 --> 01:36.065
Madam.

01:36.145 --> 01:37.145
Madam, the Saintess has been ousted.

01:37.225 --> 01:38.705
Ghost King has complete control
over Lingbi Sect now.

01:41.105 --> 01:43.225
It seems that the Ghost King

01:43.745 --> 01:45.705
is more capable than I thought.

01:46.625 --> 01:47.465
He…

01:47.985 --> 01:50.305
-He's actually the…
-Speak up!

01:51.345 --> 01:52.665
He's the Emperor of Great Qi.

01:56.785 --> 01:58.665
So, you are still alive, huh?

02:10.945 --> 02:13.585
So, you did it because of Xiao Huan?

02:14.465 --> 02:16.505
Even if you've been struck
by lethal venom,

02:16.585 --> 02:18.185
you still think
that you can protect him, huh?

02:22.785 --> 02:23.745
Useless fool.

02:29.905 --> 02:30.905
Someone.

02:31.625 --> 02:33.145
Get me the dragon robe.

02:53.025 --> 02:54.145
Your Highness,

02:54.825 --> 02:56.425
what do you think about my dragon robe?

02:57.345 --> 02:58.705
Doesn't it look great?

02:59.825 --> 03:00.665
It looks great.

03:02.745 --> 03:06.545
If so, Your Highness, please issue
an edict and announce to the world.

03:07.265 --> 03:10.185
The Xiao clan has incurred the wrath
of both Heaven and the people.

03:10.265 --> 03:13.745
I, Du Tingxin, am the chosen one.

03:13.825 --> 03:15.785
And I've won the support of the people.

03:15.865 --> 03:20.545
The Heaven-worship ceremony tomorrow
shall be my ascension ceremony.

03:22.305 --> 03:25.105
I will become the Empress of Great Qi

03:25.905 --> 03:27.905
and rule over the nation!

03:39.185 --> 03:40.865
Xiao Huan.

03:42.385 --> 03:46.585
The empire of the Xiao clan
shall fall into my hands.

03:47.305 --> 03:49.065
Come to tomorrow's ceremony

03:49.585 --> 03:51.425
if you dare.

03:52.145 --> 03:55.745
Your time on Earth is coming to an end.

03:58.065 --> 03:59.065
Oh yeah.

04:00.385 --> 04:02.745
There's your empress as well.

04:04.265 --> 04:06.905
It's only fitting she dies with you!

04:15.505 --> 04:16.345
Your Majesty,

04:16.425 --> 04:18.624
according to Shi Yan,
there's turmoil in the palace.

04:56.225 --> 04:57.745
My dear empress,

04:58.505 --> 05:00.345
look at how pitiful you look.

05:02.425 --> 05:04.345
I wanted to spare you for a few more days.

05:05.385 --> 05:07.065
But I don't feel like sparing you anymore.

05:11.905 --> 05:14.065
I hate your cocky expression the most!

05:15.105 --> 05:16.305
Listen,

05:16.385 --> 05:18.385
Xiao Huan isn't dead.

05:18.465 --> 05:20.505
Your dear emperor is still alive.

05:20.585 --> 05:23.385
But now, he's Lingbi Sect's Ghost King.

05:26.665 --> 05:27.825
Did you…

05:28.625 --> 05:29.905
Did you only find out just now?

05:31.865 --> 05:33.145
So, you guys knew all along, huh?

05:33.905 --> 05:35.425
Du Tingxin.

05:38.545 --> 05:40.465
He won't die.

05:41.905 --> 05:42.985
He will

05:45.505 --> 05:49.065
take back his throne personally.

05:49.985 --> 05:52.625
He will take back Great Qi from you.

05:52.705 --> 05:54.065
Just you wish!

05:54.585 --> 05:55.825
Listen.

05:55.905 --> 05:58.625
I only sought to keep him alive
for a few days longer.

06:02.745 --> 06:04.945
The Heaven-worship ceremony tomorrow

06:05.545 --> 06:07.385
is the day Xiao Huan dies.

06:12.345 --> 06:13.505
Don't be impatient.

06:14.825 --> 06:18.745
Now, I'll send you to the underworld,
so that you can join him down there!

06:52.185 --> 06:53.985
-Someone!
-Yes, Madam!

06:55.665 --> 06:57.865
Keep a close eye on our dear empress.

06:57.945 --> 06:59.105
Yes, Madam!

07:05.025 --> 07:06.825
Greetings, Your Majesty!

07:11.665 --> 07:12.345
You may rise.

07:12.425 --> 07:13.585
ZHEXING PAVILION

07:13.665 --> 07:16.705
Your Majesty, General Ling has divided
his 2,000 elite troops into smaller units.

07:16.785 --> 07:17.705
They will arrive
in the Capital in batches.

07:17.785 --> 07:19.745
Our forces from Southern Chu have also
arrived outside the southern gate.

07:19.825 --> 07:20.785
They will be at your service
at a moment's notice.

07:23.465 --> 07:25.745
This is the Imperial Guards' defense
deployment map for tomorrow's ceremony.

07:25.825 --> 07:27.305
Du Tingxin has already coerced
the Prince of Yuzhang

07:27.385 --> 07:28.225
to issue the imperial edict of succession.

07:28.825 --> 07:30.465
She intends to ascend
the throne during the ceremony.

07:31.185 --> 07:32.105
All right.

07:32.985 --> 07:36.185
It's time for us to end this.

07:40.945 --> 07:43.785
LINGHE HALL

08:02.225 --> 08:03.305
Your Majesty?

08:51.825 --> 08:53.065
You're awake?

08:53.745 --> 08:54.825
That's great.

09:06.345 --> 09:07.185
Your Majesty.

09:09.305 --> 09:10.265
Here you go.

09:17.945 --> 09:19.585
Cangcang, my dear wife,

09:19.665 --> 09:20.905
may my words reach you
as though we were face to face.

09:21.425 --> 09:23.345
In this life, our bond rose
and faded with fate.

09:24.305 --> 09:26.185
I vowed to stay by your side
through life and death,

09:26.265 --> 09:27.745
to grow old hand in hand.

09:28.745 --> 09:30.785
Yet who could have foreseen
a path so perilous?

09:32.905 --> 09:35.705
Life is brief, the world chaotic,

09:36.225 --> 09:37.425
and burdens weigh heavy on the heart.

09:38.425 --> 09:39.545
For the rest of my days,

09:40.065 --> 09:42.025
I wish only
that you live a life free of worry,

09:42.105 --> 09:43.505
in peace and joy.

09:43.585 --> 09:46.025
A LETTER FROM XIAO HUAN TO CANGCANG

09:46.105 --> 09:47.545
To have met you in this lifetime,

09:48.865 --> 09:50.745
I have no regrets.

09:52.385 --> 09:53.265
Deliver this to the palace.

09:53.345 --> 09:54.385
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:21.305 --> 10:24.345
WHERE FATE IS SOWN
THE HEART MAKES ITS OWN CHOICE

10:30.265 --> 10:32.105
The Heaven-worship ceremony
will be held today.

10:32.185 --> 10:34.705
His Majesty is already headed
toward Phoenix Terrace.

10:36.865 --> 10:37.745
Your Majesty.

10:39.945 --> 10:40.785
Careful.

10:42.385 --> 10:44.825
Your Majesty, we have to leave
through the back door.

10:44.905 --> 10:46.345
Guards are standing guard
over the front door.

10:46.865 --> 10:47.905
Bai.

10:49.905 --> 10:54.505
How can I leave you alone?

10:59.145 --> 11:00.185
Wait for me.

11:15.865 --> 11:18.025
QI

11:19.025 --> 11:22.385
In former times, Emperor Yao
abdicated in favor of Emperor Shun.

11:22.465 --> 11:24.185
Heaven's mandate does not remain
with the ordinary,

11:24.265 --> 11:25.905
but rests only with the virtuous.

11:25.985 --> 11:28.305
Yet now the Way of Qi has declined.

11:28.385 --> 11:30.025
The order of the world
has fallen into disarray.

11:30.105 --> 11:31.585
Calamity descended upon the Xiao clan,

11:31.665 --> 11:33.185
chaos darkened the realm,

11:33.265 --> 11:35.105
and all under Heaven was overturned.

11:35.185 --> 11:38.185
Relying on the divine might
of the Imperial Preceptor Du Tingxin,

11:38.265 --> 11:40.385
who rescued the realm
from perils on all sides

11:40.465 --> 11:42.745
and safeguarded our ancestral temples,
we have endured thus far.

11:42.825 --> 11:44.505
Now auspicious signs descend
from the Heavenly Spirits,

11:44.585 --> 11:46.305
and both men and deities
bear witness to the command.

11:46.385 --> 11:47.705
In reverence, I yield my position,

11:47.785 --> 11:49.505
that all nations might be offered peace

11:49.585 --> 11:51.105
and Heaven's Mandate solemnly upheld.

11:52.105 --> 11:56.465
Let the 10th year of Yongxi be henceforth
changed to the 1st year of Tianshuo.

11:56.985 --> 11:59.305
The treacherous ministers
acted with reckless cruelty.

12:00.505 --> 12:02.385
The loyal and righteous were murdered.

12:03.105 --> 12:04.385
They even slew their emperor
and poisoned the Empress Dowager.

12:04.465 --> 12:07.825
Such deeds are abhorrent
to both men and deities,

12:07.905 --> 12:09.425
intolerable to Heaven and Earth…

12:10.425 --> 12:12.545
Madam, please spare me!

12:12.625 --> 12:13.745
Madam!

12:14.785 --> 12:15.905
Your Highness.

12:16.785 --> 12:18.065
Read the rest of it.

12:26.545 --> 12:28.585
May I ask to whom

12:29.105 --> 12:30.945
does Great Qi truly belong?

12:31.025 --> 12:32.185
When Heaven and Earth are overturned,

12:32.785 --> 12:34.385
how can traitors
who steal the state be tolerated?

12:40.185 --> 12:44.065
Your Highness, I love it
when you're this obedient.

12:45.745 --> 12:48.145
Since someone asked me
who this state belongs to,

12:48.665 --> 12:49.665
I'll wait here

12:51.945 --> 12:54.025
and deliver the answer to him personally.

12:58.705 --> 12:59.865
Madam!

13:04.865 --> 13:07.265
The ascension ceremony mustn't be delayed.

13:07.785 --> 13:09.265
Those who deceive the people

13:10.065 --> 13:11.385
shall be executed without mercy.

13:13.865 --> 13:16.145
The Emperor is returning to the court!
Common folks, disperse!

13:24.345 --> 13:26.545
CHENGMING GATE

13:26.625 --> 13:29.305
General, all 2,000 troops
have been assembled.

13:29.385 --> 13:31.065
Surround the Capital and wait
for His Majesty's command!

13:31.145 --> 13:32.025
Yes, General!

13:59.785 --> 14:02.305
Xiao Huan. You actually showed up.

14:05.505 --> 14:07.745
Your Majesty, welcome back.

14:11.545 --> 14:14.185
All of them
are no longer under your control.

14:14.265 --> 14:16.625
Purge the court of treacherous ministers!
Slay the demoness!

14:17.585 --> 14:18.505
So what?

14:20.625 --> 14:21.785
He's still under my control.

14:29.065 --> 14:31.145
-Hongqing.
-Escort everyone to safety.

14:44.305 --> 14:45.345
Xiao Qianqing,

14:46.585 --> 14:47.425
kill him.

15:08.265 --> 15:09.625
Huan?

15:13.065 --> 15:14.185
I…

15:22.225 --> 15:23.265
Xiao Qianqing!

15:31.785 --> 15:34.105
-I will perish together with you!
-Xiao Qianqing!

15:34.185 --> 15:35.025
Xiao Qianqing!

15:38.065 --> 15:40.225
So, you were the reason

15:40.305 --> 15:41.985
he was able to break free of my control.

15:42.505 --> 15:44.745
You expelled the Heartbane
within you by force.

15:44.825 --> 15:46.505
Do you not fear death at all?

15:46.585 --> 15:48.225
Do you know who I am?

15:48.305 --> 15:49.825
I won't let you die that easily.

15:50.385 --> 15:52.465
I will tie my life to yours.

15:53.505 --> 15:55.905
You and I now share the same blood,
and we're bound by life and death.

15:57.025 --> 15:59.625
The Heartbane in me will flow
into your blood as well.

16:00.345 --> 16:01.985
When the Heartbane Bell is rung,

16:02.505 --> 16:05.785
the pain will help you break free
from the Prison of Thousand Threads.

16:08.385 --> 16:09.425
Shi Yan, Hongqing,

16:10.025 --> 16:11.265
protect them.

16:16.785 --> 16:19.945
All of you, you think
that you're full of passion.

16:20.025 --> 16:20.905
All of you want to be saints.

16:20.985 --> 16:22.385
You want to save everyone.

16:22.465 --> 16:23.825
That disgusts me to no end!

16:28.265 --> 16:30.145
It's more fun to kill people.

16:36.705 --> 16:37.945
What? Do you intend to kill me?

16:39.025 --> 16:41.785
If you kill me,
Xiao Qianqing will die as well.

16:42.905 --> 16:44.425
You cannot kill me.

16:44.945 --> 16:47.145
But I can make sure all of you die here!

16:47.225 --> 16:48.545
Du Tingxin.

16:49.305 --> 16:51.865
You can come at me
if you hate me that much.

16:51.945 --> 16:53.425
This has nothing to do with other people.

16:54.545 --> 16:55.665
You were born prone
to cold-related ailments,

16:55.745 --> 16:56.825
and your body was broken.

16:57.465 --> 16:58.785
Having endured a lifetime of suffering,
now, you want to be a wise ruler

16:58.865 --> 17:00.705
and protect the people.

17:01.745 --> 17:02.985
But I?

17:03.745 --> 17:06.665
I want to destroy everything
you want to protect.

17:12.585 --> 17:16.305
This is the ultimate Heartbane
forged from the blood of countless souls.

17:16.825 --> 17:18.785
If I attach it to the flying bugs,

17:18.865 --> 17:20.665
you won't be able to save everyone,

17:20.745 --> 17:23.224
even if you have the antidote.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.185
-Du Tingxin, have you lost your mind?
-I have!

17:44.225 --> 17:45.225
So what?

17:45.905 --> 17:48.705
I lost my mind ever since I found out

17:49.785 --> 17:51.025
that I was a princess.

17:52.385 --> 17:55.505
I lost my mind ever since I found out
that you were my elder brother.

17:56.945 --> 17:58.985
There's no longer a place
for me in the world anyway.

18:00.985 --> 18:03.145
Why don't I go all out
and lose my mind completely, then?

18:49.465 --> 18:50.385
Do you truly think

18:51.745 --> 18:52.745
you can succeed?

19:09.985 --> 19:10.945
Xiao Huan, what are you doing?

19:12.425 --> 19:15.065
The Moon-Eclipse within me
is the most lethal venom of all.

19:15.145 --> 19:16.305
Naturally, it can suppress
every venom in the world.

19:17.945 --> 19:19.145
You lost your mind?

19:19.785 --> 19:23.185
Protecting the world
and its people is my duty.

19:29.465 --> 19:30.425
Xiao Huan!

19:46.905 --> 19:48.105
Xiao Huan.

19:48.185 --> 19:50.145
You tried to trigger
the Moon-Eclipse on purpose

19:50.225 --> 19:52.065
and enhance your inner force
to kill the bugs.

19:52.585 --> 19:54.745
But that'll only make
the Moon-Eclipse go out of control.

19:55.625 --> 19:58.545
You'll lose all of your senses
and go mad soon enough.

20:00.145 --> 20:04.145
And you'll die from the pain
and torment caused by Moon-Eclipse!

20:04.225 --> 20:08.985
Hey, Bai? Bai?

20:10.545 --> 20:12.945
I am Bai Chifan.

20:13.025 --> 20:13.905
I come from Xiling.

20:13.985 --> 20:14.945
Bai Chifan.

20:15.465 --> 20:17.225
I will ensure your safety.

20:18.665 --> 20:19.745
If the ruler is here,

20:19.825 --> 20:21.345
I shall be here as well.

20:26.025 --> 20:26.865
Bai.

20:34.185 --> 20:35.025
Bai.

20:37.665 --> 20:38.665
Bai!

20:40.185 --> 20:41.185
Bai!

20:56.465 --> 20:57.345
Bai!

20:58.865 --> 20:59.865
Bai!

21:00.465 --> 21:02.345
I'm back! Bai!

21:13.465 --> 21:14.425
Bai!

21:15.545 --> 21:16.985
I'm back.

21:17.545 --> 21:18.505
Bai?

21:18.585 --> 21:20.305
-Cangcang.
-You'll be fine.

21:20.825 --> 21:21.665
You're back.

21:24.385 --> 21:26.625
I'm back. I'm Cangcang.

21:27.745 --> 21:29.265
You'll be fine.

21:36.185 --> 21:37.985
Bai, hang in there.

21:38.065 --> 21:39.025
Cangcang,

21:39.785 --> 21:41.065
it's too late.

21:41.625 --> 21:44.705
Nothing can stop the Moon-Eclipse now.

21:45.345 --> 21:46.185
Kill me.

21:58.465 --> 21:59.345
No.

22:01.545 --> 22:02.585
No, I won't.

22:03.745 --> 22:05.065
Kill me.

22:42.065 --> 22:43.065
Don't be scared.

22:44.265 --> 22:46.065
To be able to have you by my side…

22:46.785 --> 22:47.945
I no longer have any regrets.

23:09.185 --> 23:10.025
From today onward,

23:10.825 --> 23:12.185
you shall be my empress.

23:16.465 --> 23:17.785
Ling Cangcang

23:18.345 --> 23:20.065
will be my only empress.

23:26.225 --> 23:28.745
I'm here. I'll protect you.

23:34.825 --> 23:35.865
Don't leave me.

23:39.625 --> 23:40.945
Don't leave me.

23:48.425 --> 23:49.625
Cangcang.

24:34.785 --> 24:35.665
Bai?

24:39.905 --> 24:40.985
Bai.

24:44.505 --> 24:45.625
Bai.

24:51.945 --> 24:53.265
Wake up.

25:01.705 --> 25:04.305
Bai… Please wake up!

25:11.145 --> 25:12.225
Bai.

25:14.385 --> 25:15.385
Bai…

26:14.065 --> 26:15.865
Be careful. I'll hold your hand.

26:16.385 --> 26:18.345
-Don't act tough if you can't see well.
-You guys are here.

26:19.345 --> 26:22.185
Cangcang, guess what I've brought you.

26:27.545 --> 26:29.785
Lately, many people have been trying
to join Fenglai Pavilion.

26:29.865 --> 26:32.345
Someone actually gave us this to sign up.

26:35.225 --> 26:36.545
Cangcang,

26:36.625 --> 26:38.585
Fenglai Pavilion has grown
significantly stronger.

26:38.665 --> 26:41.945
All of us are waiting for you
to come back and take charge.

26:43.785 --> 26:44.705
Yeah.

26:44.785 --> 26:47.705
You should take a stroll outside
and clear your head.

26:55.705 --> 26:57.625
I appreciate your concerns.

26:57.705 --> 27:00.065
But I've made up my mind.
I've decided to stay.

27:00.865 --> 27:01.985
What did you say?

27:03.785 --> 27:06.665
I said, I've decided to stay.

27:10.465 --> 27:11.465
You still can't hear clearly, huh?

27:14.505 --> 27:16.945
Most of the toxins
in our body have been neutralized.

27:17.025 --> 27:19.265
Although it has taken a huge toll
on our bodies,

27:19.345 --> 27:20.985
we'll recover as long

27:21.065 --> 27:23.945
as we keep our minds calm
and take care of ourselves.

27:24.545 --> 27:25.825
I'll live a long life

27:26.345 --> 27:28.185
as long as you're well.

27:34.265 --> 27:36.345
This fine wine is brewed
with snowmelt from two years ago,

27:36.425 --> 27:38.225
blended with ancient blood
and red plum blossoms.

27:38.945 --> 27:40.465
It was stored in a jade vat.

27:40.545 --> 27:42.545
It was only brought out today
for us to drink together.

27:43.345 --> 27:45.145
Today is a great day.

27:45.225 --> 27:47.785
Cangcang,
let's drown our sorrow with this.

27:47.865 --> 27:50.625
Thank you. The wine is good.

27:51.305 --> 27:52.345
But…

27:53.705 --> 27:54.985
I won't take any alcohol now.

28:00.265 --> 28:01.385
I'm pregnant.

28:29.665 --> 28:32.545
HE YIGU

28:45.545 --> 28:46.585
Your Majesty?

28:54.905 --> 28:58.305
It's been so long
since I've visited Nanrong Palace.

29:00.105 --> 29:03.665
I hope that you're still willing
to chat with me.

29:05.585 --> 29:08.345
Back then, I entered the palace
and became the empress.

29:11.785 --> 29:13.785
Right after my wedding,

29:13.865 --> 29:16.545
I actually encountered Sui
again in the palace.

29:16.625 --> 29:17.465
NANSHENG PALACE

29:17.545 --> 29:20.585
Greetings, Your Majesty. I'm Du Zhisui.

29:23.265 --> 29:26.985
Initially, I thought that I would spend
my life in the palace together with Sui.

29:27.745 --> 29:29.225
But I didn't expect

29:29.985 --> 29:32.545
the late Emperor to be an inhumane beast.

29:34.225 --> 29:37.505
He forced himself on Sui on the day
I left the palace to worship Buddha.

29:39.225 --> 29:40.865
Sui gave birth to you,

29:41.465 --> 29:45.385
but she concealed
your background for my sake.

29:45.465 --> 29:46.905
Look at how adorable she looks.

29:47.625 --> 29:48.945
She has a pinkish complexion.

29:50.065 --> 29:51.225
May parents thrive together

29:51.305 --> 29:52.225
and siblings be united
in virtue and affection.

29:53.065 --> 29:54.265
Let's name her

29:54.905 --> 29:56.025
Tingxin.

29:56.785 --> 29:58.025
Du Tingxin.

29:58.825 --> 30:00.345
Let's raise her together.

30:02.865 --> 30:03.825
Xin

30:04.625 --> 30:08.105
will surely grow up to be
the most wonderful girl in the world.

30:10.825 --> 30:14.865
You left while she had to suffer alone
in the palace.

30:15.865 --> 30:17.025
Why?

30:18.225 --> 30:20.505
I happened to be there
when the late Emperor was bullying Sui.

30:20.585 --> 30:22.385
I hated him to the core.

30:23.185 --> 30:26.185
Sui duped me into leaving the palace
by telling me where the Frost Reed was.

30:29.145 --> 30:30.145
But when I left the pass,

30:31.385 --> 30:33.385
I received news that…

30:37.625 --> 30:39.865
I received news that Sui was dead.

30:42.825 --> 30:44.825
They accused Sui of having an affair
with a palace attendant.

30:44.905 --> 30:45.905
THE IMPERIAL PRECEPTOR OF GREAT QI
WAS BURNED ALIVE FOR AN OBSCENE CRIME

30:58.425 --> 31:01.145
Although I made
the late Emperor pay the price,

31:01.905 --> 31:03.745
I became a sinner myself.

31:05.145 --> 31:08.185
Huan had to spend
half of his life alone and helpless.

31:08.705 --> 31:12.065
Xin, stop being so stubborn.

31:12.705 --> 31:15.745
You're resorting to everything
to seek revenge on everyone.

31:16.985 --> 31:19.985
What makes you any different
from the people who harmed your mother?

31:20.865 --> 31:21.705
He…

31:26.705 --> 31:28.425
Is he truly dead?

32:05.185 --> 32:06.025
There's no need to be afraid.

32:06.905 --> 32:08.825
Today, I've enacted a great pardon.

32:09.785 --> 32:13.265
From now on,
you'll be the new Imperial Preceptor.

32:13.345 --> 32:14.265
I wish, Your Majesty…

32:14.345 --> 32:15.225
WUYING HALL

32:15.305 --> 32:16.785
…that you enjoy long life
and enduring happiness.

32:16.865 --> 32:19.345
May you find joy and the one you love.

32:20.225 --> 32:21.745
And never again know hesitation or doubt.

32:33.745 --> 32:36.705
Mother. I know my fault now.

32:39.105 --> 32:41.465
I want to go to you.

32:43.465 --> 32:46.585
Du Tingxin disrupted
the imperial administration

32:46.665 --> 32:48.425
with her wicked deeds,
committing heinous crimes.

32:48.945 --> 32:51.185
She shall be confined
within Nanrong Palace.

32:51.265 --> 32:54.025
She is not to leave until her death.

32:55.665 --> 32:57.465
FIVE YEARS LATER

33:00.505 --> 33:04.945
LINGHE HALL

33:22.665 --> 33:23.545
She is so good at it.

33:23.625 --> 33:24.505
So amazing.

33:24.585 --> 33:25.545
That was amazing.

34:14.264 --> 34:15.225
Bai.

34:16.385 --> 34:17.985
You loved watching my swordplay the most.

34:18.744 --> 34:20.385
I've been doing this for the past 49 days.

34:21.065 --> 34:21.945
Are you seeing this?

34:24.985 --> 34:25.824
It's been five years.

34:27.304 --> 34:29.105
I can finally visit you now.

34:49.065 --> 34:51.865
QI

35:29.105 --> 35:30.185
Bai, look.

35:31.145 --> 35:34.585
Now, Great Qi is safe and sound.

35:34.665 --> 35:35.945
The people are living a peaceful life too.

35:38.665 --> 35:40.025
You can rest at ease now.

35:42.185 --> 35:43.465
After this,

35:43.985 --> 35:46.425
our child will continue

35:46.505 --> 35:48.545
to watch over the empire
of Great Qi on your behalf.

36:05.025 --> 36:07.465
LINGHE HALL

36:10.865 --> 36:12.825
In reality, the nail punishment back then

36:12.905 --> 36:15.025
had already damaged
Her Majesty's very foundation.

36:15.545 --> 36:16.465
All these years,

36:16.545 --> 36:19.425
she was merely putting on a brave front.

36:19.505 --> 36:21.465
She knew that her condition
couldn't be treated.

36:21.985 --> 36:24.145
I'm afraid I cannot
do anything about this.

36:24.225 --> 36:25.225
Mother.

36:25.305 --> 36:27.345
I'm here.

36:27.425 --> 36:30.105
Mother, please look at me.

36:35.545 --> 36:36.385
Mother.

36:44.745 --> 36:45.585
Ning.

36:47.945 --> 36:50.065
You must safeguard the empire of Great Qi

36:55.865 --> 36:59.265
on your father's behalf.

37:00.145 --> 37:02.945
Yes, Mother. I promise you.

37:20.345 --> 37:23.385
I am Bai Chifan. I come from Xiling.

37:29.945 --> 37:31.345
Bai.

37:38.985 --> 37:40.265
I am

37:43.225 --> 37:44.385
coming.

38:02.305 --> 38:03.385
Cangcang!

38:06.105 --> 38:07.585
-Cangcang!
-Mother!

38:08.185 --> 38:09.185
Mother!

38:11.145 --> 38:12.905
Mother!

38:19.185 --> 38:20.425
Cangcang!

38:21.705 --> 38:23.265
With the wishing tree as our witness,

38:23.345 --> 38:25.385
today, I, Ling Cangcang,

38:25.465 --> 38:26.385
I, Zhong Lin,

38:26.465 --> 38:28.585
shall become sworn sisters.

38:28.665 --> 38:30.265
From now on,

38:30.345 --> 38:31.745
we will share all blessings,

38:31.825 --> 38:33.225
endure all trials.

38:33.305 --> 38:35.025
We will live and die as one

38:35.105 --> 38:36.625
and never forsake each other.

40:26.545 --> 40:29.665
QI

40:40.785 --> 40:41.745
Ning.

40:43.505 --> 40:45.305
From now on, you and I

40:45.825 --> 40:49.505
are the only ones who will safeguard
the empire of Great Qi.

40:51.425 --> 40:53.265
No. Father,

40:53.865 --> 40:55.825
Mother, and Aunt Lin,

40:55.905 --> 40:57.825
they're watching over us from above.

40:59.025 --> 40:59.945
Yeah.

41:00.465 --> 41:01.425
Ning, you're right.

41:11.465 --> 41:15.705
QI

42:03.145 --> 42:04.545
Life is but a dream.

42:05.745 --> 42:07.225
Hand in hand, we return together.
